{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628610/extras/Capture_d_\u00e9cran_2025-04-02_153119.png?t=1746450091\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <strong>Rock Valley</strong>, a small mining town that hides secrets as dark as the depths of its tunnels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong><i>Gaslighters</i></strong>, you play as a character mysteriously confined to an apartment surrounded by toxic mist. Your only connection to the outside world? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An old radio that spits out vital information and coded messages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628610/extras/radio_cap.png?t=1746450091\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unravel the threads of truth before the gas takes over everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From within the cage, watch - and listen - as Rock Valley story unfolds through the mist. As your resources grow ever thinner, find a way in the unknown and live to see tomorrow. <strong>Connect with the town</strong>, <strong>weight your options</strong> and <strong>pick sides</strong>. See through the lies and leave your name in the city's history... unless it was written in it already.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage scarce resources, solve the gloomy plot behind Rock Valley's historic mine, and do not become your worst enemy in doing so. <strong>Every day might be your last</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628610?t=1746450091","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628610?t=1746450091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628610/85209792f63a32a2b8d2a5dfaf02fb8b73b734f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746450091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628610/85209792f63a32a2b8d2a5dfaf02fb8b73b734f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746450091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3637100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628610/extras/Capture_d_\u00e9cran_2025-04-02_153119.png?t=1746450091\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <strong>Rock Valley</strong>, a small mining town that hides secrets as dark as the depths of its tunnels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong><i>Gaslighters</i></strong>, you play as a character mysteriously confined to an apartment surrounded by toxic mist. Your only connection to the outside world? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An old radio that spits out vital information and coded messages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628610/extras/radio_cap.png?t=1746450091\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unravel the threads of truth before the gas takes over everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From within the cage, watch - and listen - as Rock Valley story unfolds through the mist. As your resources grow ever thinner, find a way in the unknown and live to see tomorrow. <strong>Connect with the town</strong>, <strong>weight your options</strong> and <strong>pick sides</strong>. See through the lies and leave your name in the city's history... unless it was written in it already.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage scarce resources, solve the gloomy plot behind Rock Valley's historic mine, and do not become your worst enemy in doing so. <strong>Every day might be your last</strong>.</p>